// Joke: waited 13 years for GTA 6 (GTA V, 2013 -> GTA VI launch week 2026),
// turned into a skeleton at the desk; meanwhile the agent got paid on make.fun.
// Art is original AI-generated cartoon (no Rockstar art/screenshots); text
// overlay added with Pillow (overlay.py, Liberation Sans Bold). "make.fun"
// appears in the picture itself (bottom line), satisfying the mascot/logo/name rule.
